# Local data — Obelisk stores user bookmarks under ~/Documents/Obelisk,
# so they are never in the repo. The patterns below guard against accidentally
# copying a data directory or test database into the project tree.
bookmarks.json
usage.json
favicons/
*.icns

# Distribution outputs (regenerated by scripts/build-app.sh)
*.app/
*.zip

# Local agent reports
CODE_REVIEW_REPORT.md
